The dish is a paper plate about 18-20 cm across (roughly 260 px wide in the photo). It holds about 30 almonds.

Counting more carefully, I get roughly 28-32 almonds. A single almond weighs about 1.2 g, so 30 almonds come to about 36 g. Almonds run about 5.8 kcal per gram, so that is roughly 210 kcal.

